  "description": "Framework-agnostic core for fluent log assertions over Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Testing.FakeLogCollector. Provides ILogRecordFilter + LogFilter composable filter primitives, the failure-message rendering, the FakeLogCollector inspection extensions (Filter, CountMatching, DumpTo), event-driven waits for background logs (WaitForLogAsync, WaitForLogsAsync on FakeLogCollector.GetLogsAsync), the LogCollectorBuilder factories (Create returns a LogCapture, CreateDiscarding), and deterministic renderers for snapshot baselines (LogSnapshotRenderer for captured records, LogContractRenderer for log definitions). Test-framework-specific entry points live in adapter packages (LogAssertions.TUnit); adapters for other test frameworks are not planned, as the family targets TUnit.",
  "id": "LogAssertions",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-17T20:42:35.52Z",
